                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans have a critical choice:\n\nWill we worsen Obamacare\u2019s expansion of Medicaid?\n\nOr will we fix its flaws to ensure Medicaid works for the vulnerable Americans it was originally intended to serve?",
