                "retweet_count": 709,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Under the current budget reconciliation bill, workforce requirements for able-bodied adults on Medicaid don\u2019t kick in until 2029.\n\nEven then, they are subject to massive waivers.\n\nInexcusable is an understatement.",
